# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — CMake 4.x 拒绝 <3.5 的 cmake_minimum_required ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-01
# Software: etcd-cpp-apiv3 0.15.4
# Gate: G2/conan create (configure)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-E321
severity: 2
category: toolchain|cmake
trigger_tool: cmake|conan
phase: configure
approach: conanfile 用 cache_variables 设置 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5（切勿用 tc.variables，其写入 toolchain 文件在 cmake_minimum_required 之后加载不生效）

keywords: cmake_minimum_required, policy, VERSION_MINIMUM, CMake 4, compatibility, 3.3, 3.5

error_signature: Compatibility with CMake < 3\.5 has been removed|cmake_minimum_required\(VERSION 3\.[0-4]|CMake Error.*compatibility
match_keywords: cmake_minimum_required,compatibility,removed,cmake 4

root_cause: CMake 4.x 移除了对 <3.5 的兼容策略；大量老项目（尤其声明 3.3/3.5 的）在 configure
  阶段直接被拒绝。修复变量 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 必须在 cmake_minimum_required() 执行
  前生效。Conan 的 tc.variables 写入 conan_toolchain.cmake（在项目 CMakeLists 的
  cmake_minimum_required 之后才被 include），无效；cache_variables 走 -D 命令行参数，
  在任何 CMakeLists 解析前生效，有效
affected_scope: 所有 cmake_minimum_required(<3.5) 的老项目在 CMake 4.x 工具链下的交叉编译；
  OHOS SDK 当前 CMake 4.1.2 必然触发

rec_priority: 1
